OL,3,AMan who stole ambulance with patient
OL,4,Ainside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHad it crashed, the patient would have
OL,7,Fdied, the court heard. Leese eventually
OL,8,Fstopped at a petrol station on the A34
OL,9,Fin Newcastle-under-Lyme and fled but
OL,10,Fwas found hiding nearby by a police
OL,11,Fsniffer dog.
OL,13,FThe 32-year-old appeared at
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent Crown Court after
OL,15,Fpreviously admitting false imprisonment
OL,16,Fand aggravated vehicle taking following
OL,17,Fthe theft on 25 March.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
